ission, post-show, and emergency routines."}, {"id": "b7bd3b31-cbe5-48d9-8440-a8697eaa9959", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Show maintenance", "children": [{"id": "ff0b8ecd-910b-49e2-aecb-6fa9a52cabfe", "type": "concept", "title": "Brush-up notes"}, {"id": "36abe3da-49f3-485c-a726-7dfe4b8eb125", "type": "concept", "title": "Line notes"}, {"id": "7d1fdc25-5c37-40ed-a8bf-49ea571a7284", "type": "concept", "title": "Replacement rehearsals"}, {"id": "0ccf1051-1ca7-4a9b-8fc1-5ef5d2de34a6", "type": "concept", "title": "Quality checks"}], "description": "Why learn it: Students learn how to preserve staging, pacing, props, and cues over a run."}, {"id": "c16dbfde-5024-4f44-92b1-8373a2a47854", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Problem solving in performance", "children": [{"id": "016d34a6-32dd-49ea-a452-a8f1e2be227e", "type": "concept", "title": "Missed entrances"}, {"id": "a06d135d-0b4a-40fd-854e-86e7ae1109fd", "type": "concept", "title": "Technical failures"}, {"id": "491b132f-d4d9-462b-82aa-4e6c4d08d686", "type": "concept", "title": "Illness or injury"}, {"id": "689cbb01-c221-47f8-bb8f-d47a0e19f489", "type": "concept", "title": "Audience disruptions"}], "description": "Why learn it: Students practice calm decision-making when live conditions change."}]}, {"id": "bdbbdaf7-dc50-4aaf-b57f-f9b0b344150b", "type": "topic", "title": "Safety, Accessibility, Consent, and Intimacy Protocols", "description": "World-class stage management treats care as production infrastructure. Students learn practical protocols for reducing harm, supporting access, handling sensitive material, and knowing when to bring in qualified specialists.", "children": [{"id": "4306dead-4437-418f-bdd9-c3eb1e98b0f1", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Safety systems", "children": [{"id": "1423f56a-ebc9-4afb-bf1a-1174c5eab8ea", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk assessment"}, {"id": "169ca51e-24e6-48ea-8fdc-1c9adc1537c7", "type": "concept", "title": "Fight calls"}, {"id": "e8cdf316-e611-4437-a1e4-3dd358f6fa50", "type": "concept", "title": "First aid awareness"}, {"id": "2e9aafc4-68f2-4c50-bff9-e7a0643f88a0", "type": "concept", "title": "Incident reports"}], "description": "Why learn it: Students learn how to recognize hazards, document incidents, and support emergency response."}, {"id": "19ab1163-e6b3-41c9-aff2-2fde37544202", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Accessibility practice", "children": [{"id": "74a92c31-fee9-4472-ba92-c0fd9d91e706", "type": "concept", "title": "Access check-ins"}, {"id": "0e450319-6eee-4e44-a216-08b78026b505", "type": "concept", "title": "Communication preferences"}, {"id": "1d2b657b-2639-4462-bbf7-0a62b225d9ee", "type": "concept", "title": "Assistive technology"}, {"id": "d356e9fa-0e11-4634-bef3-10190eb2ad14", "type": "concept", "title": "Schedule transparency"}], "description": "Why learn it: Students consider access needs for performers, crew, staff, and audiences throughout rehearsal and performance."}, {"id": "d4e7c94a-896b-4404-ac92-ef8dfa7f2d83", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Consent and intimacy", "children": [{"id": "2018dd0e-caf8-4588-ab4b-7b3b84695662", "type": "concept", "title": "Closed-room protocols"}, {"id": "4e9f80ae-66ef-43d3-a9b1-acfb16c45298", "type": "concept", "title": "Boundary language"}, {"id": "ff548561-37af-4834-924a-74502533de82", "type": "concept", "title": "Documentation limits"}, {"id": "a1406552-55d7-412e-b728-7d26996fd82a", "type": "concept", "title": "Maintenance calls"}], "description": "Why learn it: Students learn the stage manager's support role in consent-based rooms while respecting the work of intimacy directors and fight/intimacy specialists."}]}, {"id": "900854a7-ce58-4e70-b6f8-4829c3ed1090", "type": "topic", "title": "Professional Standards, Unions, and Labor Ethics", "description": "This topic connects classroom practice to the realities of professional theater labor. Students learn the vocabulary of contracts, breaks, workplace standards, and ethical responsibility in union and non-union contexts.", "children": [{